WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A real Stripe sandbox payment fails.
SafeStripe follows its recovery through the saved receipt.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Stripe declines an insufficient-funds test card.
The order stays unpaid and has no paid receipt.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
The customer retries with a working test card.
The existing Checkout Session is reused.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
Stripe accepts the payment. A signed webhook is verified,
processed and saved as an authenticated Firestore receipt.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
A separate replay test records ten duplicate deliveries.
The original receipt and its paid time remain unchanged.

00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
Try SafeStripe with your own test keys.
npm install safestripe. Version 0.3.0 is an evaluation preview.
